{"hymn":"S685","parent":"E1230","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Dios planeó un nuevo hombre hacer","subtitle":"La iglesia—Como un solo y nuevo hombre","syl":{"n1":"Dios","n2":["pla","i"],"n3":["neó‿un","t"],"n4":["nue","i"],"n5":["vo‿hom","m"],"n6":["bre‿ha","m"],"n7":["cer,","t"],"n8":"Y","n9":"nos","n10":["re","i"],"n11":["di","m"],"n12":["mió","t"],"n13":["pa","i"],"n14":["ra‿u","m"],"n15":["no","t"],"n16":"ser;","n17":"Nos","n18":["com","i"],"n19":["pró","t"],"n20":"de","n22":["ca","i"],"n23":["da","t"],"n24":["na","i"],"n25":["ción,","t"],"n26":"Y","n27":"de","n28":["to","i"],"n29":["da","t"],"n30":["tri","i"],"n31":["bu","t"],"n32":"nos","n33":["lla","i"],"n34":["mó.","t"],"n35":"En","n36":"la","n37":["tie","i"],"n38":["rra,","t"],"n39":["Su‿ex","i"],"n40":["pre","m"],"n41":["sión,","t"],"n42":"Hoy","n43":["re","i"],"n44":["ve","m"],"n45":["la","t"],"n46":"Su","n47":["va","i"],"n48":["lor;","t"],"n49":"Dios","n50":["pla","i"],"n51":["ne","m"],"n52":["ó‿un","t"],"n53":["nue","i"],"n54":["vo‿hom","m"],"n55":["bre‿ha","m"],"n56":["cer,","t"],"n57":"Y","n58":"nos","n59":["re","i"],"n60":["di","m"],"n61":["mió","t"],"n62":["pa","i"],"n63":["ra‿u","m"],"n64":["no","t"],"n65":"ser."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Las ordenanzas Él clavó","En la cruz, haciendo uno de dos;","Dios con Él nos reconcilió;","La serpiente, en su cabeza hirió.","Dios derriba la pared","Cuando clamamos a Él;","Las ordenanzas Él clavó","En la cruz, haciendo uno de dos."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Tu Persona tomamos hoy","Para en un acuerdo estar, Señor;","Nuestro yo hay que abandonar","Para el Cristo-Cuerpo disfrutar.","El nuevo hombre en Cristo está,","Y la tierra ha de tomar;","Tu Persona tomamos hoy","Para en un acuerdo estar, Señor."]}]}